      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what u're saying about the moral side, but doesn't that kind of mindset make it really hard to have a stable world order? if every country decides for themselves when a \"moral imperative\" overrides international law, wouldn't that basically just mean anything goes and the strongest countries can do whatever they want to smaller ones?",
